// The coursed pattern (D178, D200, D262, D290): courses of long members, logs or beams,
// crossing at the corners; each member a profile swept along the run the layout gives,
// shaped by these numbers and its own seed (crates/terra_build/src/timber.rs), so no two
// are alike, and wearing its material's bake. A material of it (pine logs, hewn oak) is a
// few lines naming this pattern and its pack. Sizes in metres; colours as on screen (sRGB).
//
// diameter    how thick a log is, in a wall a cube thick (D175, D181)
// course      how far apart the courses are; it must divide the 3 m storey
// longest     the longest wall one log spans, as long as a tree gives (D174)
// ragged      how far short of the others' a saddle-notched corner log's end may stop
// overhang    how far a log runs past its corner cube: up to an eighth of a cube (D192)
// chinking    whether there is daub between the courses
// frame       how wide the boards round an opening are
// timber      how each member is made (D200): its profile (Round, a log in its bark; Hewn,
//             squared by the axe), its notch (Saddle, ends stacked a little ragged; Flush),
//             points round its section and rings along it (sides, step), taper, bend,
//             uneven, swell, the bark's relief by its height map, the daub under it (how far
//             out as a fraction of its half width, how tall), the line of daub that shows
//             between courses (joint, metres: the logs scribed tight, D178; 0 a full scribe),
//             its face's and ends' tints, the
//             groove's shade (D262), knots a metre, whether it weathers where exposed, and
//             how much each member differs by its seed (variation: its thickness, shade,
//             warmth and mottle; how far it has greyed toward silver, its stains, the
//             lichen on its weather face, D262)
// textures    the texture sets its members wear (assets/materials): LogEnd the sawn ends
//             (an atlas of `cells` by `cells`), Board trims, Floor a deck's boards each from
//             one plank of its texture (`strips`), Hewn its squared members; a pack adds its
//             Log face and Daub
// details     the fine grain laid over its textures near (D362): wood's, tiled every 40 cm
//             along the grain, on its logs, beams, boards and planks
// dress       each exposed edge by its role (D215): a hewn plate along every wall's top, a
//             hewn sill on what it stands on, hewn posts up every opening's sides, a log
//             along every step's nose, a log up every post (D193); dirt rising from the
//             ground
// meets       weight 2, ending against heavier kinds with an end board over its sawn ends
// toughness  how much damage a cube takes before it is destroyed (D193, D305); half its
//             cost to repair from nothing; breaking into lengths (`fragments::Breaks`)
// damage      how it breaks as it loses its health (D305): its logs, beams, boards and
//             planks split along their grain, so many splits round or across each, and
//             gouge; a log or beam loses chunks so deep out of its outline, and its sawn
//             ends splinter; their sawn ends check from the rim; the daub between crumbles
(
    pattern: Logs,
    toughness: (health: 400, breaks: Lengths),
    damage: {
        Log: Grain(splits: 5.0, chunks: 0.08),
        Hewn: Grain(splits: 3.0, chunks: 0.07),
        Board: Grain(splits: 3.0),
        Floor: Grain(splits: 9.0),
        LogEnd: Ends,
        Daub: Crumbles,
    },
    diameter: 0.3,
    course: 0.25,
    longest: 4.0,
    ragged: 0.04,
    chinking: true,
    frame: 0.08,
    timber: (
        profile: Round,
        notch: Saddle,
        sides: 18,
        step: 0.08,
        taper: 0.07,
        bend: 0.03,
        uneven: 0.035,
        swell: 0.02,
        relief: 0.022,
        daub: (0.7, 0.02),
        joint: 0.015,
        tint: (1.0, 0.92, 0.8),
        end_tint: (0.58, 0.5, 0.42),
        groove: 0.4,
        knots: 0.8,
        exposed: true,
        variation: (
            thickness: 0.06,
            shade: 0.2,
            warmth: 0.08,
            mottle: 0.1,
            age: 1.0,
            stain: 0.35,
            stain_tint: (0.7, 0.62, 0.55),
            lichen: 0.5,
            lichen_tint: (1.08, 1.14, 1.0),
        ),
    ),
    textures: {
        LogEnd: (path: "materials/log_ends", metres: (1.0, 1.0), cells: 2),
        Board: (path: "materials/weathered_planks", metres: (2.0, 2.0)),
        Floor: (path: "materials/weathered_planks", metres: (2.0, 2.0), strips: Some((0.0605, 0.1111))),
        Hewn: (path: "materials/rough_wood", metres: (0.5, 0.5)),
    },
    details: {
        Log: (path: "materials/detail_wood", metres: 0.4, strength: 0.8),
        Hewn: (path: "materials/detail_wood", metres: 0.4, strength: 0.8),
        Board: (path: "materials/detail_wood", metres: 0.4, strength: 0.8),
        Floor: (path: "materials/detail_wood", metres: 0.4, strength: 0.8),
    },
    dress: (
        roles: {
            Crest: Member(profile: Hewn, scale: 1.12, material: Hewn),
            Foot: Member(profile: Hewn, scale: 1.2, material: Hewn),
            Jamb: Member(profile: Hewn, scale: 0.6, material: Hewn),
            Nose: Member(profile: Round, scale: 1.1, material: Log),
            Post: Member(profile: Round, scale: 0.9, material: Log),
        },
        masks: (dirt: 0.9, dirt_tint: (0.6, 0.54, 0.46), moss: 0.5, moss_tint: (0.72, 0.84, 0.5)),
    ),
    meets: Some((weight: 2, end: Board, carries: None)),
    colours: (
        light: (0.74, 0.56, 0.37),
        chinking: (0.66, 0.62, 0.58),
    ),
)
